<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Targeted Genetics restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Targeted Genetics restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Vector Securities International said Tuesday it reinstated its coverage of Targeted Genetics Corp with a venture rating.</p>
<p>-- For 1996, it estimates the company will post a loss of $1.60 per share and for 1997, a loss of $0.30 per share.</p>
<p>-- Targeted Genetics is developing gene and cell therapies for the treatment of various diseases. &quot;We think the breadth and diversity of Targeted Genetics' platform make it an attractive partnering candidate to major pharmaceutical firms,&quot; Vector analyst Barbara Dau Hoffman noted in a report.</p>
<p>-- Targeted Genetics was up 1/4 at 4-5/8.</p>
<p>	   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
